WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.360 --> 00:00:07.389
Hello, and welcome to this course, Behaviour Trees and State Machines.

2
00:00:07.389 --> 00:00:15.390
Now, the project files for this and all the instructions will be based on Unreal Engine 5.5.

3
00:00:15.390 --> 00:00:23.390
However, most of the functionality has been pretty consistent all the way since 5.1,

4
00:00:23.390 --> 00:00:29.420
so this should work in other versions of the engine.

5
00:00:29.420 --> 00:00:34.219
From this course, it's divided into two parts. We're going to be the first half,

6
00:00:34.219 --> 00:00:39.259
we're going to look at behaviour trees, and the second half we're going to look at state machines.

7
00:00:39.899 --> 00:00:49.020
So we aim from this that you will be able to understand what both types of the AI are,

8
00:00:49.659 --> 00:00:57.899
and also that you'll be able to set it up, and to choose between and select the version

9
00:00:57.899 --> 00:01:07.670
which is going to be most appropriate for you. With this course, there comes a project file,

10
00:01:07.670 --> 00:01:13.590
and this project file is going to be quite important. We recommend that you download it

11
00:01:13.590 --> 00:01:20.549
and run the project. It's designed as two exercises. The first exercise is going to be

12
00:01:20.549 --> 00:01:24.709
setting up a behaviour tree, and the second exercise is going to be setting up a state

13
00:01:24.709 --> 00:01:30.709
machine. So we really do recommend that you download the project and follow along

14
00:01:30.709 --> 00:01:36.920
with the exercises as we go through this. Thank you very much.
